    "Calendar events" to "行事曆活動",
    "Calendar events you've told MigraineMe to stop suggesting. Every time the Daily Check-In's \"From your calendar\" page surfaces an event and you tap dismiss instead of tagging it as a trigger, relief, or activity, the event title lands here.\n\nFor each entry:\n• Tap the trash icon to remove it from the opt-out list. The next time an event with that title shows up in your calendar, the Daily Check-In will suggest it again.\n\nThis is the inverse of the other Manage Items pools: instead of adding things you want to track, this is the list of things you've explicitly chosen NOT to track. Useful when you accidentally dismissed something important, or when a recurring meeting title becomes relevant (e.g. you used to dismiss \"Standup\" but now want to flag standup-stress as a trigger)." to "你已告訴 MigraineMe 不要再建議的行事曆活動。每當每日檢查的「來自你的行事曆」頁面顯示某個活動，而你選擇略過，沒有將它標記為誘因、緩解方式或活動時，該活動的標題就會出現在這裡。\n\n每個項目可執行以下操作：\n• 點一下垃圾桶圖示，即可將它從不再建議的清單中移除。下次你的行事曆出現相同標題的活動時，每日檢查會再次建議它。\n\n這與其他「管理項目」清單相反：這裡不是新增你想追蹤的項目，而是列出你明確選擇「不」追蹤的項目。如果你不小心略過了重要的活動，或是某個定期會議的標題變得相關（例如你以前都略過「Standup」，現在想把站會壓力標記為誘因），這份清單就很實用。",
