    "Community Summary" to "社群",
    "Community is for adults" to "社群僅限成年人使用",
    "Community opens on Guidance. This is where the people who help you with your migraine live: practitioners you can connect with and, if you choose, share parts of your diary with. You decide exactly what they may see and you can stop the sharing at any time. That is why it comes first: it is the one thing here with consequences for your data.\n\nArticles is a library of expert-written pieces on migraine science, treatments, lifestyle changes, and patient experience.\n\nSwitch between For You (personalised to the conditions and triggers you've tagged), Latest, Browse, and Saved.\n\nForum is open discussion: post anything, comment on others, save threads.\n\nConnect to one of our AI companions in Manage Items (each one has its own focus area: nutrition, sleep, hormonal, etc.) and the For You feed re-ranks toward articles that match your subscribed companions and your actual data." to "「社群」會先開啟「指引」。這裡有協助你處理偏頭痛的人:你可以與專業人員建立連結,並在你願意的情況下與他們分享部分日誌內容。你能自行決定他們可以看到哪些內容,也可以隨時停止分享。因此它排在最前面:這是這裡唯一會影響你資料的功能。\n\n「文章」收錄由專家撰寫的內容,涵蓋偏頭痛的科學知識、治療方式、生活型態調整,以及患者的經驗分享。\n\n你可以在「為你推薦」(依你標記的狀況和誘因個人化推薦)、「最新」、「瀏覽」和「已儲存」之間切換。\n\n「論壇」是開放式討論:想發什麼都可以,也能留言回應別人、儲存討論串。\n\n在「管理項目」中連結我們的 AI 夥伴(每位都有各自專注的領域:營養、睡眠、荷爾蒙等),「為你推薦」就會重新排序,優先顯示符合你所訂閱的夥伴以及你實際資料的文章。",
