    "During an attack" to "發作期間",
    "During an attack the body is in alarm mode: fast shallow breathing, tight shoulders, a racing pulse. Slowing the breath to about six a minute is the quickest lever you have on that. It nudges the nervous system toward its calm setting, and the pain is easier to sit with." to "發作時，身體會進入警戒狀態：呼吸又快又淺、肩膀緊繃、心跳加速。把呼吸放慢到每分鐘約六次，是你最快能做到的調整方式。這會讓神經系統慢慢切換到平靜的狀態，疼痛也會比較容易承受。",
    "During an attack the neck and shoulders brace without you asking them to, the jaw clenches and the eyes screw up against the light. All of that feeds back into the same nerve centre that is already firing, and keeps it going." to "發作期間,頸部和肩膀會不由自主地繃緊,下巴咬緊,眼睛也因為怕光而瞇起。這一切都會回過頭刺激那個本來就已經在活躍的神經中樞,讓發作持續下去。",
    "During my period" to "經期期間",
    "During or after intense exercise" to "劇烈運動期間或之後",
    "Each factor made a migraine this many times likelier" to "每個因素讓偏頭痛發生的可能性提高了這麼多倍",
    "Each metric is compared between the 4 weeks before the regimen started and the most recent 4 weeks. Pick the ones that matter to you." to "每項指標都會比較開始療程前 4 週與最近 4 週的變化。請選擇對你重要的項目。",
    "Each proposal lands on this review screen with a one-tap accept or reject. You can always tweak the same values manually under Risk Model or Manage Items." to "每項建議都會顯示在這個檢視畫面,你可以一鍵接受或拒絕。你也隨時可以在「風險模型」或「管理項目」中手動調整相同的數值。",
    "Each trigger has a severity — you decide how much it matters:" to "每個誘因都有嚴重程度,由你決定它的重要性:",
    "Ear or finger sensor that coaches heart rate variability breathing through an app." to "透過 App 引導心率變異度呼吸練習的耳夾式或指戴式感測器。",
