    "Eases eye strain and light sensitivity with heat and gentle pressure around the eyes, right when an attack is building." to "在發作即將形成時,以熱敷和輕柔按壓眼周,舒緩眼睛疲勞與畏光。",
    "Eases head and temple pressure with kneading and heat across the scalp, right where tension builds during an attack." to "以揉捏和熱敷作用於整個頭皮,舒緩發作時緊繃最明顯的頭部與太陽穴壓力。",
