    "Go gently. Everything here is small. If the chin nod or the shoulder lift makes the pain worse, leave it out and just lie with the cold." to "動作要輕柔。這裡的每個動作幅度都很小。如果點下巴或抬肩讓疼痛加劇，就跳過不做，靜靜躺著冷敷就好。",
    "Go gently. If slow breathing makes you feel light-headed, breathe at whatever pace is comfortable instead." to "慢慢來。如果緩慢呼吸讓你覺得頭暈,就改用讓你覺得舒服的節奏呼吸。",
    "Go gently. Let the hand rest, not pull. Check with a clinician first if your neck pain started after an injury, or comes with dizziness or tingling in your arms." to "動作要輕柔。讓手自然放著，不要用力拉。如果你的頸部疼痛是在受傷後開始的，或伴隨頭暈、手臂刺痛麻木，請先諮詢醫療專業人員。",
    "Go gently. Let your arms slide only as far as they go without your back arching off the wall. If your neck shakes or your chin pokes forward, the lift is too high. Lower it and do fewer. Check with a clinician first if your neck pain started after an injury, or comes with dizziness or tingling in your arms." to "動作要輕柔。手臂只滑到不會讓背部離開牆面拱起的範圍就好。如果頸部發抖或下巴往前突出，表示抬得太高了，請放低一點，並減少次數。如果你的頸部疼痛是在受傷後開始的，或伴隨頭暈、手臂刺痛麻木，請先諮詢醫療專業人員。",
    "Go gently. Move only as far as feels easy, never into pain. Check with a clinician first if your neck pain started after an injury, or comes with dizziness or tingling in your arms." to "動作要輕柔。只做到感覺輕鬆的範圍，千萬不要勉強到會痛。如果你的頸部疼痛是在受傷後開始的，或伴隨頭暈、手臂刺痛麻木，請先諮詢醫療專業人員。",
    "Go gently. Tense firmly, never to the point of cramping or shaking. Skip a body part that hurts." to "動作要輕柔。穩穩地用力繃緊，但不要用力到抽筋或發抖。會痛的身體部位就跳過。",
