    "Health Connect doesn't store a recovery score. Computed locally: HRV vs your 7-day baseline (50%), resting HR vs baseline (25%, lower is better), sleep score (25%). Requires at least 7 days of HRV/RHR history." to "Health Connect 不會儲存恢復分數。由本機計算:HRV 與你 7 天基準值比較(50%)、靜止心率與基準值比較(25%,越低越好)、睡眠分數(25%)。需要至少 7 天的 HRV/靜止心率紀錄。",
    "Health Connect doesn't store a sleep score. Computed locally: 60% duration (best at 7–9h) + 40% efficiency." to "Health Connect 不會儲存睡眠分數。以下為在裝置上計算：60% 睡眠時間（7–9 小時最佳）+ 40% 睡眠效率。",
    "Health Connect not available." to "Health Connect 無法使用。",
    "Health Connect pulls health data from apps on your phone. If apps like MyFitnessPal, Cronometer, or Samsung Health share data with Health Connect, we can use it too.\n\nIf you wear a Fitbit, Samsung Watch, or another wearable we don't connect to directly, you can still bring its data in here: connect that wearable's own app to Health Connect, then Health Connect to MigraineMe." to "Health Connect 會從你手機上的應用程式取得健康資料。如果 MyFitnessPal、Cronometer 或 Samsung Health 等應用程式與 Health Connect 共享資料,我們也能使用。\n\n如果你戴的是 Fitbit、Samsung Watch 或其他我們無法直接連結的穿戴裝置,仍然可以把它的資料帶進來:先將該穿戴裝置的專屬應用程式連到 Health Connect,再將 Health Connect 連到 MigraineMe。",
    "Health Connect stores absolute body temperature. We compute deviation from your 7-day baseline (matches Whoop/Oura format). Requires at least 7 days of history; needs a compatible device." to "Health Connect 儲存的是絕對體溫。我們會計算與你 7 天基準值的偏差(與 Whoop/Oura 格式相同)。需要至少 7 天的紀錄及相容裝置。",
    "Health Connect wearables connected!" to "Health Connect 穿戴裝置已連結!",
