    "How to read it: green and grey are the gauge being right; amber and red are the two ways it can be wrong. Together the four cells cover all %s tracked days." to "閱讀方式:綠色和灰色代表風險指標判斷正確;琥珀色和紅色是判斷錯誤的兩種情況。這四格合計涵蓋所有 %s 個已記錄的日子。",
