    "MigraineMe is analysing your migraine profile to configure everything." to "MigraineMe 正在分析你的偏頭痛檔案,以完成所有設定。",
    "MigraineMe is for informational and self-tracking purposes only and is not a medical device. It does not diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent migraine or any other medical condition, and it does not provide medical advice. Always consult a qualified healthcare professional for medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment, and before making any decisions about your health." to "MigraineMe 僅供資訊參考與自我記錄之用,並非醫療器材。它不會診斷、治療、治癒或預防偏頭痛或任何其他疾病,也不提供醫療建議。如需醫療建議、診斷或治療,以及在做出任何與你健康相關的決定之前,請務必諮詢合格的醫療專業人員。",
    "MigraineMe is not a medical device and does not diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any condition. Risk estimates and insights are based on your own logged data and are not medical advice; always consult a qualified healthcare professional." to "MigraineMe 並非醫療器材，不會診斷、治療、治癒或預防任何疾病。風險估計與洞察是根據你自己記錄的資料產生，並非醫療建議；請務必諮詢合格的醫療專業人員。",
    "MigraineMe is not a medical device and does not diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any condition. This is not medical advice, always consult a qualified healthcare professional." to "MigraineMe 不是醫療器材,也不會診斷、治療、治癒或預防任何疾病。這不是醫療建議,請務必諮詢合格的醫療專業人員。",
    "MigraineMe is not a medical device and does not recommend treatments. " to "MigraineMe 並非醫療器材，也不會推薦治療方式。",
    "MigraineMe is not a medical device." to "MigraineMe 並非醫療器材。",
