    "Once a week, alongside your recalibration, MigraineMe looks at your data and suggests goals that could help, like water, sleep or heart-rate training. Your practitioner can set goals too. Switch this off to hide goals everywhere." to "每週一次,在重新校準的同時,MigraineMe 會分析你的資料,並建議可能有幫助的目標,例如喝水、睡眠或心率訓練。你的醫療專業人員也可以設定目標。關閉此選項即可隱藏所有目標。",
    "Once an attack has started. A dim, quiet room, sound low, and a cold pack wrapped in a cloth." to "發作開始後:待在昏暗安靜的房間,將音量調低,並用布包住冷敷袋。",
    "Once you own one, logging it is the point: MigraineMe compares how your attacks go " to "一旦擁有,記錄下來就是重點:MigraineMe 會比較你的發作是如何進展的 ",
