    "Open the card and tap Edit to set or correct your last period date. If your cycle is irregular, log each actual period as it happens and the prediction adjusts over time." to "開啟卡片並點選「編輯」,即可設定或修正你上次經期的日期。如果你的週期不規律,請在每次經期實際來時記錄下來,預測就會隨著時間逐漸調整。",
    "Open the category you log most often and switch off anything that doesn't apply to you. Scroll to AI Companions to follow a curator or two." to "開啟你最常記錄的類別,並關閉不適用於你的項目。往下捲動到 AI 夥伴,可以追蹤一兩位策展人。",
    "Open the drawer (top-left menu) for full control.\n\nManage Items is where everything is customisable: add your own triggers, prodromes, medicines, reliefs, symptoms, activities or locations, change the severity weighting on each one, or turn off the defaults you don't care about. It's also where you follow AI Companions to personalise your Articles feed.\n\nRisk Model lets you move your LOW / MILD / HIGH thresholds and reshape the per-day decay curve (how much today's trigger counts vs. one from 6 days ago) so the gauge reflects what an actual risky day looks like for you.\n\nData Settings controls which metrics MigraineMe pulls from your wearable, Health Connect, or HealthKit. Connections lets you link or unlink your wearable, calendar, and health platforms.\n\nNotifications, Profile, and Help round out the drawer." to "開啟側邊選單(左上角選單)即可完整掌控。\n\n「管理項目」可以自訂所有內容:新增你自己的誘因、前驅症狀、藥物、緩解方式、症狀、活動或地點,調整每個項目的嚴重程度權重,或關閉你不在意的預設項目。你也可以在這裡追蹤 AI 夥伴,讓文章動態更符合你的需求。\n\n「風險模型」可以讓你調整「低 / 輕度 / 高」的門檻,並重新塑造每日衰減曲線(今天的誘因與 6 天前的誘因各佔多少比重),讓儀表反映出對你而言真正有風險的一天是什麼樣子。\n\n「資料設定」可控制 MigraineMe 從你的穿戴裝置、Health Connect 或 HealthKit 擷取哪些指標。「連結」則可以讓你連結或取消連結穿戴裝置、行事曆和健康平台。\n\n通知、個人資料和說明也都在側邊選單中。",
