    "Resting heart rate, HRV, oxygen, breathing rate." to "靜止心率、HRV、血氧、呼吸速率。",
    "Resting heart rate, HRV, steps and activity. Low HRV and elevated resting HR often precede a migraine by 12-48 hours — your autonomic nervous system shifts before the attack starts. Sudden bursts of intense exercise can also trigger.\n\nUseful as an early-warning signal: if HRV drops well below your baseline, treat that day as higher-risk even if you feel fine." to "靜止心率、HRV、步數與活動量。HRV 偏低、靜止心率升高，往往會在偏頭痛前 12–48 小時出現，因為你的自律神經系統在發作前就已經改變。突然的劇烈運動也可能誘發。\n\n可當作預警訊號：如果 HRV 明顯低於你的基準值，即使感覺良好，也請把那一天視為風險較高的日子。",
