    "Risk History" to "風險紀錄",
    "Risk Model" to "風險模型",
    "Risk Model shapes your gauge with two things:\n\nThresholds are where LOW becomes MILD and MILD becomes HIGH. They define the colour bands on the meter, so they reflect what an actual risky day looks like for you.\n\nDecay curve is how heavily today's triggers count versus one from 6 days ago. The bucket has a 7-day memory; this curve sets the weight on each day.\n\nAt the end of this onboarding, our AI will set both up for you based on what you tell us. This screen is here just in case reality doesn't match our suggestions and you want to fine-tune.\n\nOn top of that, the weekly AI Calibration automatically nudges these values 20-30% toward whatever actually predicts your attacks. So the gauge keeps sharpening itself over time, even if you never touch this screen." to "風險模型透過兩個部分來調整你的指示器：\n\n門檻是「低」變成「輕度」、「輕度」變成「高」的分界點。它們決定量表上的色帶，所以能反映對你來說真正高風險的一天是什麼樣子。\n\n衰減曲線決定今天的誘因與 6 天前的誘因各佔多少比重。水桶有 7 天的記憶，這條曲線會設定每一天的權重。\n\n完成這段引導設定後，我們的 AI 會根據你提供的資訊幫你設好這兩項。這個畫面只是為了在實際情況與我們的建議不符、而你想自行微調時使用。\n\n此外，每週的 AI 校準會自動把這些數值朝著最能預測你發作的方向調整 20-30%。所以即使你從未開啟這個畫面，指示器也會隨著時間越來越準。",
