    "Setup" to "設定",
    "Sev %s/10" to "強度%s/10",
    "Seven cards that turn your logs into something actionable.\n\nFull Report builds a doctor-ready PDF with every metric for the period you choose. AI Recommendations reads your data and suggests changes across six categories (triggers, prodromes, medicines, reliefs, activities, symptoms), including overuse flags for medicines.\n\nAccuracy scores your gauge against what actually happened: true positives, false alarms, and missed attacks. What Happened ranks each trigger and prodrome by how much it lifts your attack risk.\n\nWhat Worked scores each treatment by its impact on severity and duration. What Were You Doing shows which activities and locations turn up most around your attacks. How Did It Impact You rolls up severity, duration, pain locations, aura location and missed activities." to "七張卡片，把你的記錄變成可以實際運用的資訊。\n\n完整報告會為你選擇的期間產生一份可交給醫師的 PDF，包含所有指標。AI 建議會讀取你的資料，並在六個類別（誘因、前驅症狀、藥物、緩解方式、活動、症狀）提出調整建議，也包括藥物過度使用的提醒。\n\n準確度會把你的儀表與實際發生的情況做比較：正確預測、誤報和漏掉的發作。發生了什麼會依照每個誘因和前驅症狀提高你發作風險的程度來排序。\n\n什麼有效會根據對嚴重程度和持續時間的影響，為每種治療評分。你當時在做什麼會顯示哪些活動和地點最常出現在你的發作前後。對你有何影響則彙整嚴重程度、持續時間、疼痛位置、預兆位置和錯過的活動。",
