    "Stay on top of your migraine risk with timely alerts. MigraineMe sends you daily check-in reminders and warns you when your risk spikes." to "透過適時的提醒，隨時掌握你的偏頭痛風險。MigraineMe 會每天提醒你進行每日檢視，並在你的風險升高時發出警示。",
