    "Still ongoing" to "仍在進行中",
    "Still quick, but with a bit more choice. The home strip is one-tap-and-done; this Quick Log lets you pick any item from your full pool (not just your favourites), set the time to something other than right now, and add notes.\n\nFor medicines and reliefs you can also log the amount, how much it helped, and any side effects, so this is the right place when you've taken something specific and want it recorded properly.\n\nActivity logging lives here too. For a full attack with everything that goes around it (timing, symptoms, pain, prodromes, triggers, medicines, reliefs, locations, activities, postdromes, missed activities and notes), use the \"Log Migraine\" hero card above." to "依然快速，但選擇更多。首頁的快捷列只要點一下就完成；這個快速記錄則讓你從完整清單中挑選任何項目（不只是你的最愛），把時間設成現在以外的時間，還能加上備註。\n\n針對藥物和緩解方式，你也可以記錄用量、有多大幫助，以及任何副作用，所以當你服用了特定的東西、想好好記下來時，就適合在這裡進行。\n\n活動也可以在這裡記錄。如果要記錄一次完整的發作及其相關的一切（時間、症狀、疼痛、前驅症狀、誘因、藥物、緩解方式、地點、活動、後期症狀、錯過的活動和備註），請使用上方的「記錄偏頭痛」主卡片。",
    "Still setting up in the background" to "仍在背景中進行設定",
    "Still stuck? Email help@migraineme.app and we'll sort it out." to "還是無法解決嗎？請寄信至 help@migraineme.app，我們會協助你處理。",
