    "Stress low" to "壓力偏低",
    "Stress score, mood, screen time. \"Let-down\" migraines are real, relaxing after high stress (weekend, after a deadline, on holiday) triggers an attack in many people. Sustained high stress is also a top trigger.\n\nUse this card to spot let-down patterns: if you see migraines clustered on Fridays / Saturdays, that's often the signal.\n\nNoise: sampled from your phone mic. Shown as Quiet, Moderate, Loud, or Very loud so you can read it at a glance. The underlying score is kept for correlations and trigger detection." to "壓力分數、情緒、螢幕使用時間。「放鬆型」偏頭痛確實存在：在高壓之後放鬆下來（週末、截止日之後、度假時），會讓許多人出現發作。長期的高壓力也是主要誘因之一。\n\n你可以用這張卡片找出放鬆型的規律：如果你發現偏頭痛集中在週五或週六，那通常就是訊號。\n\n噪音：透過手機麥克風取樣。顯示為安靜、適中、大聲或非常大聲，讓你一眼就能看懂。原始分數會保留下來，用於關聯分析和誘因偵測。",
