    "To record ambient noise levels, MigraineMe needs microphone access.\n\n" to "為了記錄環境噪音量,MigraineMe 需要使用麥克風的權限。\n\n",
    "To show screen time insights, MigraineMe needs Usage Access permission.\n\n" to "為了顯示螢幕使用時間洞察,MigraineMe 需要「使用情況存取」權限。\n\n",
