    "Today's Weather" to "今日天氣",
    "Today's nutrition totals + the three metrics you've pinned. We track classic migraine-relevant ones: caffeine, sodium, sugar, tyramine, alcohol, gluten and histamine. Both excess AND deficiency matter — skipping your usual coffee triggers attacks as often as too much.\n\nAutomatic classification depends on what your nutrition app sends to Health Connect. Not all apps forward per-food data — some send only daily nutrient totals, which we can use for numbers but not classify by name. The barcode scanner and USDA search on the detail page always classify correctly, so those are the most reliable way to log known trigger foods." to "今日的營養總量，加上你釘選的三項指標。我們追蹤與偏頭痛相關的常見項目：咖啡因、鈉、糖、酪胺、酒精、麩質和組織胺。過量和不足都很重要：沒喝平常的咖啡，引發發作的機率和喝太多一樣高。\n\n自動分類取決於你的營養 App 傳送給 Health Connect 的內容。並非所有 App 都會轉送每種食物的資料，有些只傳送每日營養素總量，我們可以用來計算數字，但無法依名稱分類。詳細頁面上的條碼掃描和 USDA 搜尋一定能正確分類，因此是記錄已知誘因食物最可靠的方式。",
    "Today's nutrition totals + the three metrics you've pinned. We track classic migraine-relevant ones: caffeine, sodium, sugar, tyramine, alcohol, gluten, histamine and the additives aspartame, MSG, nitrates and sulfites. Both excess AND deficiency matter — skipping your usual coffee triggers attacks as often as too much.\n\nAutomatic classification depends on what your nutrition app sends to Health Connect. Not all apps forward per-food data — some send only daily nutrient totals, which we can use for numbers but not classify by name. The barcode scanner and USDA search on the detail page always classify correctly, so those are the most reliable way to log known trigger foods." to "今日營養總量,加上你釘選的三項指標。我們追蹤與偏頭痛相關的經典項目:咖啡因、鈉、糖、酪胺、酒精、麩質、組織胺,以及添加物阿斯巴甜、味精、硝酸鹽和亞硫酸鹽。過量和不足都很重要——少喝平常的咖啡,和喝太多一樣常誘發發作。\n\n自動分類取決於你的營養 App 傳送到 Health Connect 的內容。並非所有 App 都會轉送每項食物的資料,有些只傳送每日營養素總量,我們可以用來顯示數字,但無法依名稱分類。詳細頁面上的條碼掃描和 USDA 搜尋一律能正確分類,因此是記錄已知誘因食物最可靠的方式。",
